### Topic 58 - Kafka sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
### Start Kafka first:  docker compose up -d     then: mvn spring-boot:run
### Watch the app log: SENT ... partition=.. offset=..  /  NOTIFY ...  /  ANALYTICS ...
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create an order -> CREATED event (copy the orderId from the response)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Asha", "amount": 899.99 }

### 2. Pay the order (replace the id) -> same key -> same partition -> kept in order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/PUT-ORDER-ID-HERE/status/PAID?customerName=Asha

### 3. Ship the order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/PUT-ORDER-ID-HERE/status/SHIPPED?customerName=Asha

### 4. Analytics counters (consumer group "analytics-service")
GET {{base}}/api/analytics

### 5. Temporary failure -> 3 attempts, then the record goes to orders.DLT
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "fail", "amount": 10 }

### 6. Invalid data (negative amount) -> NOT retried, straight to orders.DLT
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Ravi", "amount": -5 }

### 7. Validation error -> 400, nothing is sent to Kafka
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "" }
